  "info.nerodecor.chroma_hub": "The heart of a Chroma network. Use it with an empty hand to open the hub screen: paint linked blocks, sort them into zones, keep a palette, store and play scenes, and grant roles. Viewers look, Painters paint and play scenes, Admins manage zones, channels and auto-adopt, and the Owner grants roles. Sneak-use toggles auto-adopt (Admins).",
  "info.nerodecor.chroma_linker": "Chooses which blocks a Chroma Hub controls. Use it on a hub to bind it (Admin role). Use it on a chroma-capable block to link it, or again to unlink it. Use it in the air to switch to Box mode: mark two corners to link every capable block between them. Sneak-use on a block flood-links the capable blocks touching it.",
  "info.nerodecor.paint_gun": "Paints blocks without a hub. Use it on a paintable block to paint it the gun's colour. Sneak-use on a block copies that block's colour into the gun. Use it in the air for the next colour, sneak-use in the air for the previous one.",
  "info.nerodecor.scene_chip": "Carries one Chroma scene between hubs. Sneak-use on a hub to copy the scene it is playing onto the chip. Use the chip on another hub to load the scene into a free slot and play it (Painter role). In the hub screen, Copy and Import move the same scene as a share code (ND1-...).",
